  "definition": "Credits",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-02-07",
  "historyNote": "#4799, Interim, eff 8-22-90, exp. 6-1-90; ss by #4954, eff 10-16-90; ss by #6336, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1607); ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1606.01); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
